#: main.cpp:31
msgid ""
"A program to view the differences between files and optionally generate a "
"diff."
msgstr "Program untuk melihat perbezaan di antara fail dan menjana diff jika dipilih."

#: main.cpp:37
msgid ""
"Document to open. If only one URL is given, it is\n"
"considered to be a .diff file. If the file is a -\n"
"then Kompare will read from stdin, this can be used\n"
"for cvs diff | kompare -. If 2 files are given,\n"
"Kompare will compare them."
msgstr ""
"Dokumen untuk dibuka. Jika hanya satu URL diberikan,\n"
"dokumen akan dianggap fail diff\n"
"Jika fail ialah - kemudian Kompare akan membaca dari\n"
"stdin, yang boleh digunakan untuk cvs diff | kompare - . Jika 2 fail diberikan,\n"
"Kompare akan bandingkan fail tersebut."

